{"title":"Harpy","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Harpy that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 22 times (1.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: diveSpeedMult: 1.6</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/gilded-plume\">Gilded Plume</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>101</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>142</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>1,478</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>1,114</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>236</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>61</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>36</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>122</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>163</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>58</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>37</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/harpy?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>131